OL,4,BJeers, injuries and doubters - White's 
OL,5,Bjourney back to the top                
OL,6,GBen White's crucial goal against world 
OL,7,Gchampions Spain on Sunday will not be  
OL,8,Gforgotten by England fans for a long   
OL,9,Gtime.                                  
OL,11,FA smart finish to cap a flowing Three  
OL,12,FLions move gave Thomas Tuchel's men an 
OL,13,Falmost unbelievable 3-0 lead in        
OL,14,FMadrid. They hung on - just - meaning  
OL,15,FWhite will always be remembered as the 
OL,16,Fplayer who scored that winner.         
